Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: daemoncores-kernel-{{ KVER }} (= {{ VER }})
Description: Device-specific kernel modules for {{ DEVICE }}
 This package contains the kernel modules specific to the {{ DEVICE }}
 device overlay (SoC, Ethernet PHY, MMC, USB, RTC). It is built on top
 of the project kernel (daemoncores-kernel) and must be installed
 alongside it.
